ion: absolute;\n      right: 35px;\n      top: 437px;\n      color: #20276e;\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n    .rules {\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      padding-left: 12px;\n      color: #20276e;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 22px;\n    }\n    .rules .indent { padding-left: 22px; }\n    .brand {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 20px;\n      right: 15px;\n      color: #7092bb;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      letter-spacing: .5px;\n    }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"header\"><span>No.</span><span>Date</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"example green\">例：设&nbsp; $A=$</div>\n      <div class=\"matrix-block green\">\n        $\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;[?]\\\\4&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;6&amp;-4\\end{pmatrix}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"matrix-block green\" style=\"padding-top:4px;\">\n        $B=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3&amp;4\\\\0&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\3&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}$\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"work\">求$AB$</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"line blue\" style=\"margin-top:-84px; margin-left:26px;\">\n      $AB=\\begin{pmatrix}-8&amp;6&amp;7\\\\10&amp;2&amp;-6\\\\-2&amp;17&amp;10\\end{pmatrix}$\n      <span class=\"small\"> $=1\\times0+0\\times1+[?]\\times[?]$</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">2．比较</div>\n\n    <div class=\"compare\">\n      <div class=\"compare-left\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <span class=\"label\">行列式：</span>\n          <span class=\"math\">$\\left|\\begin{matrix}a_{11}&amp;a_{12}\\\\a_{21}&amp;a_{22}\\end{matrix}\\right|\\quad\n            \\left|\\begin{matrix}b_{11}&amp;b_{12}&amp;b_{13}\\\\b_{21}&amp;b_{22}&amp;b_{23}\\\\b_{31}&amp;b_{32}&amp;b_{33}\\end{matrix}\\right|$</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <span class=\"label\">矩阵：</span>\n          <span class=\"math\">$\\left[\\begin{matrix}a_{11}&amp;a_{12}\\\\a_{21}&amp;a_{22}\\end{matrix}\\right]\\quad\n            \\left[\\begin{matrix}b_{11}&amp;b_{12}&amp;b_{13}\\\\b_{21}&amp;b_{22}&amp;b_{23}\\\\b_{31}&amp;b_{32}&amp;b_{33}\\end{matrix}\\right]$</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"compare-right\">\n        <div>△ 只有当第一个矩阵的</div>\n        <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;列数与第二个</div>\n        <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;矩阵的行数相等时，</div>\n        <div>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;两个矩阵才能相乘</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"definition\">概念<br><br>无意义</div>\n\n    <div class=\"shape\">\n      相乘结果矩阵形状：结果矩阵行数 = 第一个矩阵的行数<br>\n      列数：第二个矩阵的列数\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"formula\">\n      （相）相乘，取两个：&nbsp; $A_{m\\times n}\\cdot B_{n\\times s}=C_{m\\times s}$\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"examples\">\n      <div class=\"ex1\"><span class=\"exlabel\">例：</span>$\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}[?]\\\\[?]\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}10\\end{pmatrix}$</div>\n      <div class=\"ex2\">$\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;4\\\\[?]&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\n        \\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-6\\\\-2&amp;[?]\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\n        =\\begin{pmatrix}-16&amp;-32\\\\8&amp;16\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$</div>\n      <div class=\"ex3\">$\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;4\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\n        \\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;4\\\\1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}\n        =\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}_{2\\times2}$</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"abnote\">$AB\\ne BA$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"rules\">\n      <div>① 矩阵乘法一般不满足交换律</div>\n      <div>② 矩阵$A\\ne0$，$B\\ne0$　或有$AB=0$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent\">从而不能由 $AB=0$ 得出 $A=0$ 或 $B=0$ 的结论</div>\n      <div>③　$AB=AC,\\ A\\ne0$　并不 $\\Rightarrow B=C$</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"brand\">KOKUYO</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
